%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lore_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bbe146643d6caf2478fe4f018f1c5ef5, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items:
    - rid: 4707331672703763100
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 303992832
    m_Localized: "Night shift rota. Rule 1: the lights stay on. Rule 2: if the lights go out, do not run. Running is how it finds you. \u2014 Supervisor Okafor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878912
    m_Localized: Patient 7 keeps drawing stars on the walls. Says they are "the way down". We paint over them. By morning they are back, and they glow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878913
    m_Localized: 'Maintenance log: pressure nominal. Fuse 3 tripped again. Someone keeps pressing the lockdown buttons at 3 a.m. Nobody is on shift at 3 a.m.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878914
    m_Localized: 'To whoever finds this: the shutters were never meant to keep you in. They were built to slow it down. It hates doors. Close them behind you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878915
    m_Localized: The chapel candles are the only lights they could not cut. Light one. It does not help much. It helps enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878916
    m_Localized: "Burial register, final page: \"Subject A \u2014 released to lower levels.\" There is no grave. There was never a grave."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878917
    m_Localized: 'Service unit trial 14: the old robots freeze under direct observation. Engineering calls it a bug. I watched one move every time my torch flickered. It is not a bug.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878918
    m_Localized: We never switched the service units off. We turned off the lights in their bay and stopped looking. That was enough, for a while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878919
    m_Localized: If you are reading this, you got further than we did. The way out at the bottom is real. It opens once. Take the stars with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878920
    m_Localized: Last entry. It is not hunting you. It is following. Every floor you clear, it comes one floor down. Do not stop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878921
    m_Localized: 'TO WHOEVER WAKES NEXT


      They keep the lights low down here, and something walks the halls between the beds. Five stars lie in the dark. Gather them and the hatch will open. It always opens. It never stays open long.


      - a night nurse, Ward 1'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878922
    m_Localized: "CASE FILE \xB7 PATIENT 3 \xB7 HILDE BRANDT\n\nAdmitted for counting. Counts the doors on Ward A, aloud, all night. Insists there is always one more door than yesterday.\n\nStaff note: she is right. Maintenance cannot explain the new door on Ward A. Keep her away from it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878923
    m_Localized: "CASE FILE \xB7 PATIENT 11 \xB7 TOMAS REINER\n\nFormer stoker. Hears footsteps in the pipes and answers them. Two knocks: all clear. Three knocks: hide.\n\nStaff note: since the Boiler Room was sealed, the pipes knock back. Nobody on staff knocks three times."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878924
    m_Localized: "CASE FILE \xB7 PATIENT 5 \xB7 ELIAS VOGT\n\nSleepwalker. Found every morning at the morgue doors, eyes open, holding his own wristband. Says drawer five \"has his name on\".\n\nStaff note: drawer five does have his name on. Nobody wrote it. Transfer to Surgery approved."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878925
    m_Localized: "CASE FILE \xB7 SUBJECT A\n\nProcedure 1: removal of fear. Successful. The subject no longer sleeps, no longer speaks, no longer stops.\n\nReleased to the lower levels to keep them quiet. Staff note: the lower levels are quiet now. Everyone down there is very, very quiet."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878926
    m_Localized: "DIRECTOR KARLHEINZ \xB7 PRIVATE\n\nThe service units keep the lights. Subject A keeps the dark. The stars show the patients the way down, and the way down brings them back to Intake. A closed system.\n\nIt needs one more patient to close. The file is on my desk."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878927
    m_Localized: "CASE FILE \xB7 PATIENT 7\n\nAdmitted: fourteen times. Draws stars on the walls. Reaches the bottom every time, holding the stars, and walks back in through Intake asking where the beds are.\n\nTreatment: none effective.\n\nDirector's note: there is a switch behind this desk. It turns everything off. The units, the dark, the subject, the Asylum. I never had the courage. Patient 7 might."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878928
    m_Localized: "P3 \xB7 HILDE BRANDT"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878929
    m_Localized: "P11 \xB7 TOMAS REINER"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878930
    m_Localized: "P5 \xB7 ELIAS VOGT"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878931
    m_Localized: SUBJECT A
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878932
    m_Localized: "DIRECTOR \xB7 PRIVATE"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878933
    m_Localized: PATIENT 7
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878934
    m_Localized: The wristband is cold. Drawer five is open.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878935
    m_Localized: DISCHARGED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878936
    m_Localized: The main doors open on the night. The cold is real. Behind you, a light comes on in the Intake ward. Someone is making up a bed. You know who it is for.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878937
    m_Localized: LIGHTS OUT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878938
    m_Localized: You pull the switch. Every lamp in Karlheinz dies at once, and for the first time nothing moves in the dark. No footsteps. No knocking. No counting. Patient 7 is discharged. This time, nobody makes up the bed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878939
    m_Localized: ADMITTED AGAIN. ASKED WHERE THE BEDS ARE. SLEPT BEHIND THE STATUE.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878940
    m_Localized: 'ADMITTED AGAIN. ASKED WHERE THE BEDS ARE. SLEPT BEHIND THE STATUE.

      IT IS YOUR HANDWRITING.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878941
    m_Localized: "EVACUATION ORDER \xB7 NIGHT OF THE 14TH \xB7 WARD A FIRST. DO NOT"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878942
    m_Localized: SOMEONE HAS BEEN COUNTING THE DOORS.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387878943
    m_Localized: 'ADMISSIONS: {list}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331672703763100
  - m_Id: 392073216
    m_Localized: 'ADMISSIONS: {list}, AND {n} MORE'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331672703763100
  - m_Id: 392073217
    m_Localized: PATIENT {mark}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331672703763100
  - m_Id: 392073218
    m_Localized: "ROTA \xB7 OKAFOR \xB7 LIGHTS STAY ON."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 392073219
    m_Localized: "ROTA \xB7 OKAFOR \xB7 LIGHTS STAY ON.\nCOUNT AT SIX. COUNT AT SIX."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 392073220
    m_Localized: ROOM 4. EMPTY. THE LAMP IS WARM.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 392073221
    m_Localized: 'BAY LIGHTS: OFF. DO NOT LOOK IN.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 392073222
    m_Localized: TWO DENTS IN THE PIPE. THE STEEL IS STILL WARM.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 392073223
    m_Localized: THREE DENTS IN THE PIPE. THE STEEL IS STILL WARM.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 392073224
    m_Localized: RELEASED TO LOWER LEVELS. SUBJECT A. DO NOT FOLLOW.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 392073225
    m_Localized: THEY BARRICADED THE DOOR. FROM THE INSIDE.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 392073226
    m_Localized: THE TABLE HAS BEEN SHOVED. FROM THE OTHER SIDE.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 392073227
    m_Localized: A CHALK HOUSE WITH MORE WINDOWS THAN THE REAL ONE.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 392073228
    m_Localized: A CHALK HOUSE, SMEARED OUT BY A HAND.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635253641216
    m_Localized: THE ORDERLY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635324944384
    m_Localized: It hunts by sight and by sound, and it only takes you when it can see you. Light, footsteps and anything thrown tell it where you are. It learns what you lean on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635324944385
    m_Localized: STAN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635324944386
    m_Localized: He moves only while no light is on him and freezes in the beam. His touch drains your torch. He has never killed anyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635324944387
    m_Localized: THE VISITOR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635324944388
    m_Localized: It lives in the corridor that loops and comes closer only while you are not looking. Learn the corridor; turn back when something is wrong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635324944389
    m_Localized: THE LISTENER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635324944390
    m_Localized: Blind. It lies still until it hears you, then crawls to the sound. When it screams, it lunges at the last noise it heard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635324944391
    m_Localized: THE TENANT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635324944392
    m_Localized: 'One locker is already taken. Listen before you hide: it breathes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635324944393
    m_Localized: THE BODIES
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635324944394
    m_Localized: Not all of them are dead. A hanging one drops on whoever passes in the dark; one on the floor crawls toward your light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4806058725773312
    m_Localized: "ELIAS \u2014 THE FROST (SUBJECT #5)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4806058805465088
    m_Localized: 'Pronounced dead on Ward C and wheeled down to Drawer #5 before his chest stopped moving. In the deep DESCENT levels he walks alone: the Orderly does not enter a floor he has claimed. He extinguishes the corridor lamps one by one, turning the remaining bulbs ice-blue as he nears, and tracks the white plume of exhausted breath in the dark. A focused beam held on his face makes him flinch back, for a moment.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
